{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB「新聞女神」林婷婷今年1月與同台主播李天耀喜結連理，婚後兩人火速重返工作崗位，近期更因鏡頭前後的甜蜜互動引發網民熱議。</p><p>有眼利觀眾在收看TVB新聞直播時，發現背景有男女主播暗中放閃，截圖瘋傳後被指正是這對新婚夫婦。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:50.468538+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.017501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.017501+00:00","content_hash":"552af039517c2fc867ab7133459f822fffd6dc659b7f8ecfcc5ab145011a6693","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}